{"build":"6c7a310@16/11/2026, 18:43:24","data":{"book":{"title":"Gaudija Gītandžalī","subtitle":"Vaišnavu dziesmas un lūgšanas","slug":"lv","sort_order":5,"songsCount":91},"descriptions":[{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},{"title":"Гаудия Гитанджали","subtitle":"Cборник вайшнавских песен и молитв","slug":"ru","sort_order":2,"render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":3},"songsCount":178},{"title":"Guía de Kīrtan","subtitle":"Edición Detallada. Con traducción palabra por palabra y explicación de estilo","slug":"es","sort_order":3,"songsCount":146},{"title":"Gaudija Gītandžalī","subtitle":"Vaišnavu dziesmas un lūgšanas","slug":"lv","sort_order":5,"songsCount":91},{"title":"Ґаудія Ґітанджалі","subtitle":"Вайшнавський пісенник українскою мовою","slug":"ua","sort_order":6,"language":"uk","render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":4},"songsCount":71},{"title":"Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Chiang Mai English Edition, 2022","slug":"en-2022","sort_order":8,"hidden":true,"songsCount":166}],"nav":{"199":{"prev":{"path":"/lv/radha-krishna-prana-mora-jugala-kishora/","title":"Sakhi-vṛnde Vijñaptiḥ"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":199,"first_line":"rādhākuṇḍataṭa-kuñjakuṭīra","author":"Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs"},"title":["Rādhā-kuṇḍataṭa-kuñja-kuṭīra"],"author":["Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["rādhākuṇḍataṭa-kuñjakuṭīra","govardhana-parvata jāmuna-tīra"],"translation":["Dzīve Vradžas birzīs pie Rādha-*kundas*, Govardhana kalns, Jamūnas upes krasti;"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["kusuma-sarovara, mānasa-gaṅgā","kalinda-nandinī vipula-taraṅgā"],"translation":["Kusum-*sarovāra* ezers, Mānasa-ganga upe, Jamūnas, saules meitas, līganie viļņi;"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["vaṁśīvaṭa, gokula, dhīrasamīra","vṛndāvana-taru latikā-vānīra"],"translation":["*Rasas* dejas norises vieta un Gokula, maigās vēsmas, Vradžas koki, vīnogulāji un vetasas palmas;"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["khaga-mṛgakula, malaya-bātāsa","mayura, bhramara, muralī-vilāsa"],"translation":["Putni un meža zvēri, pavasara saldais gaiss, pāvi, kamenes un apburošā flautas skaņa;"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["veṇu, śṛṇga, padachihna, meghamālā","vasanta, śaśāṅka, śaṅkha karatālā"],"translation":["Flauta, ganu rags, viņa pēdu nospiedumi, mākoņu rindas debessjumā, pavasaris, mēness, gliemežnīcas skaņa, karatāli."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["jugala vilāse anukūla jāni","līlā-vilāsa-uddīpaka māni"],"translation":["Es zinu, ka tas viss uztur un bagātina Dievišķā Pāra mūžīgās rotaļas; es jūtu, kā tas atmodina Kunga svētās *līlas*."],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["e soba choḍata kā̐hā nāhi jāu̐","e soba choḍata parāṇa hārāu̐"],"translation":["Es nekad nevarēšu pamest šīs man tik ļoti dārgās lietas. Es zinu, ka bez tām es miršu."],"isLong":false},{"number":"8","text":["bhaktivinoda kohe, śuno kāna","tuyā uddīpaka hāmārā parāṇa"],"translation":["“Uzklausi mani, Kāna,” saka Bhaktivinoda, “Tu esi manas dzīves vienīgā gaisma.”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sridhar-maharaj-and-govinda-5","personSlug":"srila-b-r-sridhar-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/krsnachaitanya-das/36-radha-kunda-tata-5","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.R. Madhusudan Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/madhusudan-maharaj-day-programm-kisel","personSlug":"srila-b-r-madhusudan-maharaj"},{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/32-radhakundatata-kunjakutira","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/radha-kundatata","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/lv/radhakundatata-kunjakutira/","description":"Rādhā-kuṇḍataṭa-kuñja-kuṭīra — vaišnavu dziesma ar vārdiem, tulkojumu latviešu valodā un skaidrojumu vārdu pa vārdam. Autors — Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs. No grāmatas «Gaudija Gītandžalī».","title":"Rādhā-kuṇḍataṭa-kuñja-kuṭīra. Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"lv","slug":"radhakundatata-kunjakutira"}}